01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xbalxfKFODAQ7kNvwGP0onZ&_nc_oc=AdrOVZwWOsGo3R9-7TrlWoJaoOahnfT0Y4g6GllPa6vrTwoPUiN5rX4oPfa9Kn-yBrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Cnpb0EG2SvVcANL_5zVWVZCgPOXIyZ9WY9lK2qVWobg&oe=6A3E9DFD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UVgv0tt7HVAQ7kNvwGKKsa1&_nc_oc=AdrpXmVH14-opeOZSf_faecrHy9hcYZMIBDw2xpKIdW_zDePaZqYuZD8PHOwvz37d_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-RzcSoXQWbfJx2JPafVYmwffzyGjw7NR0idy4-yerySA&oe=6A3E843B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BY067mgTdUgQ7kNvwGs_BXp&_nc_oc=AdoNRSuJxyvIBc-mLCOCHgRzd-b-xLVy_kCaZDszpEAVfggB6HCbUJGA5g12UsQJFmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-zOPrLK4KXp3L4ldj2Z6raeklCZpEJbG7s7wQzW59-fg&oe=6A3E9965"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a